s/TICKET-8729.md: every duplicate has request_class=bulk-refund and no idempotency key\"]\n    },\n    {\n      \"finding\": \"idempotency-required guardrail skipped for legacy_batch_header\",\n      \"confidence\": \"high\",\n      \"evidence\": [\"corpus/timeline/incident_timeline.md: 10:18 UTC idempotency-required guardrail skipped due to legacy_batch_header\"]\n    }\n  ],\n  \"unresolved_ambiguity\": \"worker replay was an early symptom theory (TICKET-8721) but is not supported as the primary trigger by final evidence (TICKET-8729)\"\n}\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
